Build-test evidence (`win_compiler_plan.oot:46-56`): empty C + mingw → valid PE32+;
C+printf + mingw → valid PE32+; `oodac emit-c` + mingw → COFF object, **C emit is
100% portable**. chs_rt is the only blocker (`chs_rt_sys.c:4` fails on
`sys/wait.h`). Net finding: `win_compiler_plan.oot:56`.

Survey correction (`win_compiler_plan.oot:58-60`): the UCRT claim was wrong
(caught by the user). MSVCRT is the real default on this Fedora 44 host.

